  "name": "rs-metadata",
  "description": "An LUMC profile of CodeMeta 3.1 for research software metadata, with a validator that checks codemeta.json against the profile and keeps it consistent with every other metadata file in the repository, including CITATION.cff, .zenodo.json, packaging manifests and the repository's own GitHub metadata. Ships as a command-line tool and as a reusable GitHub Action.",
